<<include"OC Arthur NPC Character Menu Avatar Display">>

Kind and sweet, but hyperactive and loud. An easy going, fun loving, and very respectful boy who is also kind of a crybaby. Can never stay still for long periods of time, he's very active and enjoys sports. He wears his heart on his sleeve and is very caring about others. Arthur loves music, reading and art, he can be seen either dancing around, reading a book or drawing. He's a picky eater but will never say no to a good cookie.

